{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the old-school cRPG grind, BBS MUDs of the 1990s and early MMORPGs.\u00a0 Developed by a solo newbie developer, Landonia is a single-player, turn-based RPG that includes possibilities of parties upto 16 player-characters, treasures, grinding, questing, and classic cRPG play.\u00a0 \u00a0There are numerous factions that can be allied with or fought against, and NPCs will battle each other if the circumstances arise.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game has a story-mode and separate arena battle-royale mode:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upto 16 player characters that you create can be used interchangeably in either mode. Items, gold, and experience carry over from each mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game has three separate modes of combat:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Default) ARPG style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control 1 player in continuous mode, with (upto-15) party members supporting you automatically based upon your party settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based + Party AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode is just like ARPG style but the game pauses when it's your character's turn. Party members will automatically support based upon your settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Turn-Based (Turn-Based + Party Manual).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control every player when it is their turn to move. It will automatically switch to the party member whose turn it is.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/b52e7810ee73af66ca6f400a362745c94021d1cd.jpg"},{"name":"PRESS_X","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/2984ea5531c67fb8964a0ad693a6e6fb76ba21e8.jpg"},{"name":"Lead a group","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/97862e7aa10f108bfb3c542e19639b6cb5bd6c7c.jpg"},{"name":"Mining","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/85caf1f03b9b85d39faabff52a520a3ac4ac13c6.jpg"},{"name":"Horse Riding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/8a45fdaac55ee6bda746a7a3fd48131cf44523bc.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394040?t=1756699349","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394040?t=1756699349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/f33f6aeaf2632c82d06935f2dd62a9a343bd1820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756699349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/f33f6aeaf2632c82d06935f2dd62a9a343bd1820/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756699349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the old-school cRPG grind, BBS MUDs of the 1990s and early MMORPGs.\u00a0 Developed by a solo newbie developer, Landonia is a single-player, turn-based RPG that includes possibilities of parties upto 16 player-characters, treasures, grinding, questing, and classic cRPG play.\u00a0 \u00a0There are numerous factions that can be allied with or fought against, and NPCs will battle each other if the circumstances arise.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game has a story-mode and separate arena battle-royale mode:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upto 16 player characters that you create can be used interchangeably in either mode. Items, gold, and experience carry over from each mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game has three separate modes of combat:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Default) ARPG style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control 1 player in continuous mode, with (upto-15) party members supporting you automatically based upon your party settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based + Party AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode is just like ARPG style but the game pauses when it's your character's turn. Party members will automatically support based upon your settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Turn-Based (Turn-Based + Party Manual).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control every player when it is their turn to move. It will automatically switch to the party member whose turn it is.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ocanaday"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/header.jpg?t=1756699349","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Landonia copyright 2024","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257151923,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151923/movie480.mp4?t=1749162412","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151923/movie_max.mp4?t=1749162412"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151923/0a6e9d6ff5687523a7d78b936c756e22feeb436d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749162412","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_